RUN: apinotes-test %S/Inputs/Headers/TypedVsLegacy.apinotes | FileCheck %s

This locks down that omitted Parameters and explicit Parameters: [] remain
distinct on the YAML round-trip output.

CHECK: ---
CHECK: - Name:            ping
CHECK-NEXT: Availability:    none
CHECK-NEXT: AvailabilityMsg: legacy ping unavailable
CHECK: - Name:            ping
CHECK-NEXT: Parameters:      []
CHECK-NEXT: Availability:    none
CHECK-NEXT: AvailabilityMsg: zero-arg ping unavailable
CHECK: - Name:            selfOnly
CHECK-NEXT: Parameters:
CHECK-NEXT: - Position:        -1
CHECK-NEXT: Type:            'TypedVsLegacy *'
CHECK: ...
